  message: "Materialized from dogfood tranche 05 (F83.A1 / anon-card-007). Mechanism: message-queue linker matches MQ pattern strings in TEST-FILE string literals and cross-links publisher↔subscriber across unrelated test files by topic. Evidence: frozen substrate.json — 103 event_publishes total, 26 cross-file; sample edge test_linker_docstring_fp_regression.py:27-27 -> test_linkers_text_filters.py:52-52 (topic_match, conf=0.9). Fresh repro: hypergumbo run /tmp/mqtest on copies of the 3 test files reproduced 103 event_publishes / 26 cross-file. Blind severity 4/5, reproduced (genuine repo files, not injection). RELATED_BUT_DISTINCT from WI-vavur (done — linkers regex-match their own module DOCSTRINGS/prose → phantom nodes; this is test-BODY string literals plus a cross-file topic-join) and WI-vurig (done — yjs_crdt linker should gate on manifest-detected framework presence; same family of unconditional text-pattern linker FPs but different linker and no cross-file join). Also distinct from WI-zadot (kind tagging) and WI-popok (entrypoint test heuristic)."  # 9845
